<title>USA: Best Buy in deal with states on advertising.</title>
<headline>Best Buy in deal with states on advertising.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Best Buy Co Inc said Monday it entered a pact with the attorneys general of several states that develops industry standards and guidelines for advertising zero-percent financing programs.  </p>
<p>The computer superstore retailer said the agreement clarifies the way retailers disclose to consumers terms and conditions of special financing programs. Best Buy did not say what states entered the agreement.</p>
<p>The company said it already had been adhering to the guidelines before entering the pact.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
